{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zfUdqvijQh1792739830.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人植耀輝於節目中推介台積電(TSM)，指公司第三季業績維持強勁增長，公司對今季展望更佳，而市場對先進封裝及製程需求仍大，相信繼續交出好的業績，近日股價跟隨大市調整，正好提供買入機會。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"5323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026zY4KSb31Bj1792739823.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>植耀輝認為現價即413.17美元可買入，目標價上望480美元，若失守360美元便止蝕。</p><p>台積電(TSM)</p><p></p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→413.17美元</p><p>目標：480美元</p><p>止蝕：360美元</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"5324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264JSWYJELgj1792739858.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>股評人張智威推介中移動(941)，他認為業績後股價調整已反映，而目前股市波動下，他認為派息高的股份仍有避險功能。</p><p></p><p>張智威建議現價即77.35元買入，目標價看82元，止蝕價在70元。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"5325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026n6FwgBEY0G1792744349.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>中移動(941)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：現價→$77.35</p><p>目標：$82</p><p>止蝕：$70</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"5326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hC0orjqXcr1792740460.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:06.629604+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:11.766367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:18.019711+00:00","content_hash":"ef348a1ad935e99ef015336e1271e21863c0b141384182c3136c0a4fc74b11f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null